        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gallium, semiconductor-grade, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gallium, semiconductor-grade, at regional storage
Transport of gallium to european regional storage, this module calls the module "gallium, semiconductor-grade, at plant".;
CAS number: 007440-55-3; 
Formula: Ga; 
UUID: 12b06d54-6ebe-3838-afc0-cba0caf2a388
The module includes the production from gallium as well as the transport of gallium from global production places to europe.
Location: RER
Technology: Transport
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 60 t in 2005
Sampling: Analysis based on literature. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_12b06d54-6ebe-3838-afc0-cba0caf2a388.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
